@host = http://localhost:5160
@authToken = <your-jwt-token-here>
@routeUid = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Obtener todas las vías de escalada
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Obtener vías con filtros
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute?climbZoneId=1&difficultyScaleNameId=1&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Obtener una vía por UID
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute/{{routeUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Crear una vía de escalada
POST {{host}}/api/climbRoute
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "La Huella del Oso",
  "description": "Vía de escalada deportiva con fuerte crux en el segundo tercio",
  "difficultyScaleId": 1,
  "difficultyScaleNameId": 1,
  "climbTagId": null,
  "pitchCount": 1,
  "firstAscentDate": "2023-06-15T00:00:00Z",
  "climbZoneId": 1
}

###

### 5. Actualizar una vía
PUT {{host}}/api/climbRoute/{{routeUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "La Huella del Oso - Variante",
  "description": "Descripción actualizada",
  "difficultyScaleId": 2,
  "climbTagId": null,
  "pitchCount": 2,
  "climbZoneId": 1
}

###

### 6. Eliminar una vía
DELETE {{host}}/api/climbRoute/{{routeUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 7. Obtener escalas de dificultad
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute/difficulty-scales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Obtener escalas de dificultad por nombre de escala
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute/difficulty-scales?difficultyScaleNameId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

# ─── Descripciones de Vía ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@climbRouteId = 1

### 9. Obtener descripciones de una vía
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute/{{climbRouteId}}/descriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Crear descripción para una vía
POST {{host}}/api/climbRoute/description
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "climbRouteId": 1,
  "title": "Aproximación",
  "body": "Desde el pueblo se toma la senda sur durante 45 minutos hasta la pared. Señalizada con cairns.",
  "section": "Approach",
  "languageCode": "es",
  "authorId": 1
}

###

# ─── Tags de Escalada ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 11. Obtener todos los tags de escalada
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. Crear tag de escalada
POST {{host}}/api/climbRoute/tag
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fisura",
  "description": "Vía con protagonismo de fisuras para la progresión",
  "color": "#FF6B35"
}

###

# ─── Rock Features ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 13. Obtener características de roca de una vía
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute/{{climbRouteId}}/rock-features
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 14. Crear características de roca para una vía
POST {{host}}/api/climbRoute/rock-features
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "climbRouteId": 1,
  "rockType": "Granito",
  "texture": "Rugoso",
  "holdTypes": ["Regleta", "Presa", "Pinza"],
  "wallAngle": "Vertical",
  "qualityRating": 4,
  "notes": "Roca de excelente calidad, bien consolidada. Algunos sectores con líquenes.",
  "isSportRouting": true,
  "isTraditionalRouting": false
}

###
